{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-05/1061583/block/singleImage/3255550/df/01KR2YJMWBFAA9NNJJ90QSASAD.jpeg?updatedAt=1793609894\"/><figcaption>香港警方</figcaption></figure><p>西貢發生爆竊案。 今日（2日）清晨6時38分，西貢南山新村一間獨立屋房間窗戶被撬開，屋內有搜掠痕跡，懷疑遭爆竊，外傭於是報警。警方接報到場，經初步點算，相信單位75歲姓楊男住戶有約值44萬元的財物不翼而飛，包括手鐲、戒指、手錶及耳環等。警方將案件列「爆竊」，交由黃大仙警區刑事調查隊第三隊跟進，暫未有人被捕。據了解，案中手錶為HStern，價值約7.8萬元。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T09:41:23.163136+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":184,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T08:58:14+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T14:18:41.738198+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T09:38:33.654484+00:00","content_hash":"02bfc94974fe11e50defe345db3d9a6ed095b3cac64dfbe148beecfebe64fe68","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}